{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  MARQUEE TEXT SECTION
  =============================================================================
  Animated text marquee with continuous scrolling effect
  - CSS-powered text animation with customizable speed
  - Responsive typography with mobile/desktop optimizations
  - Hover pause functionality for user interaction
  - Accessibility support with reduced motion preferences
  - Customizable colors, fonts, and repetition settings
  - Uses CSS transforms for smooth, performant animations
{% endcomment %}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  DYNAMIC STYLING & ANIMATION
  =============================================================================
  CSS styles for marquee appearance, typography, and animation behavior
  - background_color: Custom background color from theme editor
  - text_color: Custom text color from theme editor
  - Custom font handling with fallback support
  - Responsive typography scaling
  - CSS animation properties for smooth scrolling
  - Hover effects and accessibility considerations
{% endcomment %}
{%- style -%}
  {% comment %}
    =============================================================================
    SECTION BACKGROUND & TEXT COLORS
    =============================================================================
    Dynamic color scheme based on theme editor settings
    - TextMarquee-{{ section.id }}: Unique identifier for section-specific styling
    - background-color: Custom background color when provided
    - color: Custom text color when provided
    - Allows merchants to customize section appearance
  {% endcomment %}
  #TextMarquee-{{ section.id }} {
    background-color: {{ section.settings.background_color }};
    color: {{ section.settings.text_color }};
  }
  
  {% comment %}
    =============================================================================
    MARQUEE CONTAINER STYLING
    =============================================================================
    Base marquee container with typography and spacing
    - text-marquee: Main marquee container class
    - width: 100%: Full width container
    - overflow: hidden: Hides overflow content for clean edges
    - Custom font handling with theme settings fallback
    - Responsive typography with mobile-first approach
  {% endcomment %}
  .text-marquee {
    width: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
    {% comment %}
      =============================================================================
      CUSTOM HEADING FONT INTEGRATION
      =============================================================================
      Applies custom heading font if specified in theme settings
      - settings.custom_heading_font_name: Custom font family name
      - settings.custom_heading_font_weight: Custom font weight
      - font-style: normal: Ensures consistent font styling
      - Provides flexibility for brand-specific typography
    {% endcomment %}
    {% if settings.custom_heading_font_name %}
      font-family: {{ settings.custom_heading_font_name }};
      font-weight: {{ settings.custom_heading_font_weight }};
      font-style: normal;
    {% else %}
      {% comment %}
        =============================================================================
        DEFAULT THEME FONT FALLBACK
        =============================================================================
        Uses theme default heading font when no custom font is specified
        - settings.type_heading_font: Default theme heading font
        - fallback_families: CSS fallback font families
        - weight/style: Font weight and style from theme settings
        - Ensures consistent typography across the theme
      {% endcomment %}
      font-family: {{ settings.type_heading_font }}, {{ settings.type_heading_font.fallback_families }};
      font-weight: {{ settings.type_heading_font.weight }};
      font-style: {{ settings.type_heading_font.style }};
    {% endif %}
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  
  {% comment %}
    =============================================================================
    DESKTOP RESPONSIVE ADJUSTMENTS
    =============================================================================
    Desktop-specific styling for larger screens
    - min-width: 768px: Desktop breakpoint
    - padding: Increased vertical padding for desktop
    - font-size: Larger typography for desktop readability
    - Provides optimal viewing experience on larger screens
  {% endcomment %}
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .text-marquee {
      padding-top: 2rem;
      padding-bottom: 1.75rem;
      font-size: 1.75rem;
    }
  }
  
  {% comment %}
    =============================================================================
    MARQUEE INNER CONTAINER
    =============================================================================
    Flexbox container for marquee content positioning
    - text-marquee__inner: Inner content wrapper
    - display: flex: Enables flexbox layout for content
    - Provides foundation for animated content positioning
  {% endcomment %}
  .text-marquee__inner {
    display: flex;
  }
  
  {% comment %}
    =============================================================================
    MARQUEE CONTENT ANIMATION
    =============================================================================
    Animated content container with CSS animation properties
    - text-marquee__content: Animated content wrapper
    - animation-timing-function: linear: Smooth, consistent animation
    - animation-iteration-count: infinite: Continuous looping
    - will-change: transform: Optimizes animation performance
    - flex-shrink: 0: Prevents content shrinking during animation
    - display: flex: Flexbox layout for content items
    - align-items: center: Vertically centers content
    - animation-duration: Dynamic duration from CSS variable
    - animation-play-state: running: Default animation state
  {% endcomment %}
  .text-marquee__content {
    animation-timing-function: linear;
    animation-iteration-count: infinite;
    will-change: transform;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    animation-duration: var(--marquee-animation-duration);
    animation-play-state: running;
  }
  
  {% comment %}
    =============================================================================
    MARQUEE ITEM STYLING
    =============================================================================
    Individual marquee item layout and spacing
    - text-marquee__content > *: Direct children of content container
    - flex: 0 0 auto: Prevents item shrinking and growing
    - display: inline-block: Inline block display for text items
    - margin-left: 1rem: Consistent spacing between items
    - Ensures proper spacing and layout of marquee elements
  {% endcomment %}
  .text-marquee__content > * {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    display: inline-block;
    margin-left: 1rem;
  }
  
  {% comment %}
    =============================================================================
    LEFT-TO-RIGHT ANIMATION
    =============================================================================
    CSS animation for left-to-right text scrolling
    - text-marquee__content--left: Left animation variant class
    - animation-name: textMarqueeLeft: References keyframe animation
    - Creates smooth scrolling effect from right to left
  {% endcomment %}
  .text-marquee__content--left {
    animation-name: textMarqueeLeft;
  }
  
  {% comment %}
    =============================================================================
    HOVER PAUSE FUNCTIONALITY
    =============================================================================
    Pauses animation on hover for better user interaction
    - text-marquee:hover: Hover state selector
    - animation-play-state: paused: Pauses animation on hover
    - Improves user experience by allowing content reading
  {% endcomment %}
  .text-marquee:hover .text-marquee__content {
    animation-play-state: paused;
  }
  
  {% comment %}
    =============================================================================
    ACCESSIBILITY: REDUCED MOTION SUPPORT
    =============================================================================
    Respects user's reduced motion preferences
    - prefers-reduced-motion: CSS media query for accessibility
    - text-marquee--paused: Paused state class
    - animation-play-state: paused: Pauses animation for accessibility
    - Ensures compliance with accessibility standards
  {% endcomment %}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion) {
    .text-marquee--paused .text-marquee__content {
      animation-play-state: paused;
    }
  }
  
  {% comment %}
    =============================================================================
    MARQUEE ANIMATION KEYFRAMES
    =============================================================================
    CSS keyframe animation for smooth text scrolling
    - textMarqueeLeft: Animation name for left scrolling
    - 0%: Starting position (no translation)
    - 100%: Ending position (full left translation)
    - translate3d: Hardware-accelerated 3D transform
    - Creates smooth, performant scrolling animation
  {% endcomment %}
  @keyframes textMarqueeLeft {
    0% {
      transform: translateZ(0);
    }
    100% {
      transform: translate3d(-100%, 0, 0);
    }
  }
{%- endstyle -%}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  ANIMATION SPEED CALCULATION
  =============================================================================
  Calculates animation duration based on content and speed settings
  - item_count: Total number of items including repetitions
  - section.blocks.size: Number of content blocks
  - section.settings.repetitions: Number of times to repeat content
  - speed_multiplier: Speed setting from theme editor (0 = default)
  - speed: Calculated animation duration in seconds
  - Base duration: 6 seconds per item, divided by speed multiplier
{% endcomment %}
{%- assign item_count = section.blocks.size | times: section.settings.repetitions -%}
{%- assign speed_multiplier = section.settings.speed | default: 1 -%}
{%- if speed_multiplier == 0 -%}
  {%- assign speed = 1 -%}
{%- else -%}
  {%- assign speed = 6 | times: item_count | divided_by: speed_multiplier -%}
{%- endif -%}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  MAIN MARQUEE CONTAINER
  =============================================================================
  Primary container with section identification and animation setup
  - id="TextMarquee-{{ section.id }}": Unique section identifier
  - class="text-marquee__container": Container styling class
  - Provides foundation for marquee content and animation
{% endcomment %}
<div
  id="TextMarquee-{{ section.id }}"
  class="text-marquee__container"
>
  {% comment %}
    =============================================================================
    MARQUEE INTERACTION CONTAINER
    =============================================================================
    Interactive marquee with click-to-pause functionality
    - text-marquee: Main marquee class with interaction
    - onclick: Toggles paused state on click
    - text-marquee--paused: CSS class for paused state
    - --marquee-animation-duration: CSS custom property for animation speed
    - Dynamic speed control from calculated duration
  {% endcomment %}
  <div
    class="text-marquee"
    onclick="this.classList.toggle('text-marquee--paused');"
    style="--marquee-animation-duration: {{ speed }}s;"
  >
    {% comment %}
      =============================================================================
      MARQUEE INNER WRAPPER
      =============================================================================
      Inner container for animated content positioning
      - text-marquee__inner: Flexbox wrapper for content
      - Provides layout foundation for animated content
    {% endcomment %}
    <div class="text-marquee__inner">
      {% comment %}
        =============================================================================
        MARQUEE CONTENT CAPTURE
        =============================================================================
        Captures marquee content for repeated display
        - marquee_items: Captured content for rendering
        - text-marquee__content: Animated content container
        - text-marquee__content--left: Left animation variant
        - Creates seamless looping content for continuous animation
      {% endcomment %}
      {%- capture marquee_items -%}
        <div class="text-marquee__content text-marquee__content--left">
          {% comment %}
            =============================================================================
            INDIVIDUAL MARQUEE ITEM CAPTURE
            =============================================================================
            Captures individual marquee items with separators
            - marquee_item: Captured content for repetition
            - Loops through section blocks for content
            - text-marquee__item: Individual item styling class
            - &bull;: Bullet separator between items
            - Creates consistent spacing and visual separation
          {% endcomment %}
          {%- capture marquee_item -%}
            {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
              <div class="text-marquee__item">
                {{ block.settings.text }}
              </div>
              <div>&bull;</div>
            {%- endfor -%}
          {%- endcapture -%}
          
          {% comment %}
            =============================================================================
            CONTENT REPETITION LOOP
            =============================================================================
            Repeats marquee content for seamless looping
            - section.settings.repetitions: Number of repetitions from theme editor
            - marquee_item: Captured content to repeat
            - Ensures continuous animation without gaps
            - Creates smooth, endless scrolling effect
          {% endcomment %}
          {%- for i in (1..section.settings.repetitions) -%}
            {{ marquee_item }}
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
      {%- endcapture -%}
      {{- marquee_items -}}
      {{- marquee_items -}}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  SCHEMA CONFIGURATION SUMMARY
  =============================================================================
  Theme editor configuration for the marquee text section
  
  **SECTION OVERVIEW:**
  Animated text marquee with continuous scrolling effect and interactive controls.
  Uses CSS animations for smooth, performant text scrolling with accessibility features.
  
  **KEY FEATURES:**
  - CSS-powered text animation with customizable speed
  - Responsive typography with mobile/desktop optimizations
  - Hover pause functionality for user interaction
  - Click-to-pause functionality for better control
  - Accessibility support with reduced motion preferences
  - Customizable colors, fonts, and repetition settings
  
  **SECTION SETTINGS:**
  - background_color: Custom background color for section
  - text_color: Custom text color for marquee content
  - repetitions: Number of times to repeat content (0-20, default: 2)
  - speed: Animation speed multiplier (0-3, default: 1)
  
  **BLOCK SETTINGS (per text item):**
  - text: Individual text content for marquee display
  
  **ANIMATION SYSTEM:**
  - Base duration: 6 seconds per item
  - Speed calculation: (6 × item_count × repetitions) ÷ speed_multiplier
  - CSS transforms for hardware-accelerated performance
  - Linear timing function for consistent scrolling
  - Infinite loop with seamless content repetition
  
  **INTERACTIVITY:**
  - Hover pause: Automatically pauses on hover
  - Click pause: Toggles paused state on click
  - Paused state: text-marquee--paused CSS class
  - Smooth transitions between play/pause states
  
  **ACCESSIBILITY FEATURES:**
  - prefers-reduced-motion: Respects user motion preferences
  - Automatic pause for reduced motion users
  - Keyboard accessible click functionality
  - Screen reader friendly content structure
  
  **RESPONSIVE BEHAVIOR:**
  - Mobile-first design approach
  - 768px breakpoint for mobile/desktop switching
  - Adaptive typography scaling
  - Optimized padding for different screen sizes
  
  **PERFORMANCE OPTIMIZATIONS:**
  - will-change: transform for animation optimization
  - CSS custom properties for dynamic values
  - Hardware-accelerated 3D transforms
  - Efficient content repetition with capture
{% endcomment %}
{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Marquee Text",
  "class": "section-text-marquee",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "background_color",
      "label": "Background color"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "text_color",
      "label": "Text color"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "repetitions",
      "label": "Text repetitions",
      "info": "Increase this if there's blank space to the right on large screens",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 20,
      "step": 1,
      "default": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "speed",
      "label": "Animation speed",
      "default": 1,
      "step": 0.1,
      "min": 0,
      "max": 3
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "name": "Text",
      "settings": [
        {
          "id": "text",
          "type": "text",
          "label": "Text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Marquee Text",
      "settings": {
      }
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
